---
description: >-
  Numeric-timestamp variant using a lowercase "dateFormat x" (Unix
  milliseconds), the counterpart to the sibling "-2" fixture that uses
  uppercase "dateFormat X" (Unix seconds) for the same pipeline task.
---
gantt
  title Process time profile (ms)
  dateFormat x
  axisFormat %L
  tickInterval 250millisecond

  section Pipeline
  Parse JSON p1: 000, 120
